x676c: service the inherited TOPRGU watchdog independently of scanout

Display-off must not stop the armed hardware watchdog heartbeat. Use a separate
workloop and timer, bound its interval from the inherited LENGTH, preserve
MODE/LENGTH and report the initial registers and first service gaps. Own and
quiesce the MMIO mapping and callback lifetime. The diagnostic reset is unchanged.

